{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The|strong=\"H5921\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"said to|strong=\"H1980\"me|strong=\"H5921\", “Go|strong=\"H1980\", and|strong=\"H1980\"buy|strong=\"H7069\"yourself|strong=\"H5921\"a|strong=\"H3068\"linen|strong=\"H6593\"belt, and|strong=\"H1980\"put|strong=\"H7760\"it|strong=\"H7760\"on|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H3068\"waist|strong=\"H4975\", and|strong=\"H1980\"don’t put|strong=\"H7760\"it|strong=\"H7760\"in|strong=\"H5921\"water|strong=\"H4325\".”   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"So|strong=\"H7760\"I|strong=\"H5921\"bought|strong=\"H7069\"a|strong=\"H3068\"belt according|strong=\"H5921\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H5921\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s word|strong=\"H1697\", and|strong=\"H3068\"put|strong=\"H7760\"it|strong=\"H7760\"on|strong=\"H5921\"my|strong=\"H3068\"waist|strong=\"H4975\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"The|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s word|strong=\"H1697\"came|strong=\"H1961\"to|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H1697\"the|strong=\"H3068\"second|strong=\"H8145\"time|strong=\"H8145\", saying|strong=\"H1697\",  \n"},{"number":4,"text":"“Take|strong=\"H3947\"the|strong=\"H5921\"belt that|strong=\"H6965\"you|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H3947\"bought|strong=\"H7069\", which|strong=\"H8033\"is|strong=\"H8033\"on|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"waist|strong=\"H4975\", and|strong=\"H6965\"arise|strong=\"H6965\", go|strong=\"H3212\"to|strong=\"H3212\"the|strong=\"H5921\"Euphrates|strong=\"H6578\", and|strong=\"H6965\"hide|strong=\"H2934\"it|strong=\"H5921\"there|strong=\"H8033\"in|strong=\"H5921\"a|strong=\"H3068\"cleft of|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"rock|strong=\"H5553\".”   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"So|strong=\"H6680\"I|strong=\"H6680\"went|strong=\"H3212\"and|strong=\"H3068\"hid|strong=\"H2934\"it|strong=\"H3068\"by|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"Euphrates|strong=\"H6578\", as|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"commanded|strong=\"H6680\"me|strong=\"H6680\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"After